From: Fractal Microsystems <bsp@fractalmicro.org>
Subject: [PATCH] h432b: validate and update slot-matched MMC extensions

Bind persistent slot activation to the kernel-declared MMC extension.
Probe the internal SD block device, validate its provisioned GPT layout,
and permit only inactive extension writes with independent readback.
Keep provisioning and userdata outside the fastboot image interface.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board integration]

diff --git a/board/fractalmicro/h432b/Makefile b/board/fractalmicro/h432b/Makefile
--- a/board/fractalmicro/h432b/Makefile
+++ b/board/fractalmicro/h432b/Makefile
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 obj-y += board.o timer.o usb.o nand.o storage.o cache.o
-obj-$(CONFIG_MMC) += mmc.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_MMC) += mmc.o mmc-update.o
 obj-y += recovery-menu.o
